  "description": "Javangaleh is a modern settlement situated near Ajab\u0161ir (Maragheh) in the East Azerbaijan Province in the northwest of Iran. Here a rock inscription of Argi\u0161ti I (eighth century BCE) was found which reports his victory over the land Mana (CTU I A 8-13).",
